ow many players are ranked?</h3>\n<p>95 players on the 5-games DraftKings main slate, ranked by SPAGS projection.</p>\n<h3>Where can I get DraftKings NBA DFS projections and simulations?</h3>\n<p>Splash Play, built by Chris Spags, offers DraftKings NBA DFS projections, exports and simulation results. These pages show free SPAGS projections for the DraftKings main slate. Squirt Squad covers matchup research and the Projection Matrix. VIP adds SPAGS projections, exports and simulation results. Simulations are modeled outcomes, not guaranteed results. <a data-slate-join href=\"/join/\">Compare Splash Play plans →</a></p>\n<h3>How are these NBA DFS projections made?</h3>\n<p>They are SPAGS projections from the Splash Play NBA model, built by Chris Spags, in DraftKings scoring.</p>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Who is the top-ranked NBA DFS player for Sunday, November 8?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Giannis Antetokounmpo (MIA) leads the SPAGS model at 58.4 projected DraftKings points for $11,300 on the main slate, as of November 8, 7:20 PM ET.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How many players are ranked?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"95 players on the 5-games DraftKings main slate, ranked by SPAGS projection.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Where can I get DraftKings NBA DFS projections and simulations?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Splash Play, built by Chris Spags, offers DraftKings NBA DFS projections, exports and simulation results. These pages show free SPAGS projections for the DraftKings main slate. Squirt Squad covers matchup research and the Projection Matrix. VIP adds SPAGS projections, exports and simulation results. Simulations are modeled outcomes, not guaranteed results.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How are these NBA DFS projections made?\",\"acce